. Project Overview
The objective of this project is to design and develop financial analytics dashboards using Power BI. The system will transform raw financial data into interactive dashboards and financial statements to help stakeholders analyze company performance.
The Power BI solution will include preparation of:
•	Profit & Loss Statement (Income Statement)
•	Balance Sheet
•	Cash Flow Statement
•	Statement of Changes in Equity
•	Financial Ratios
•	Financial Dashboards
These reports will support financial decision-making, business analysis, and performance monitoring.
