7. DAX Measures
Total Revenue
Total Revenue =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(Fact_Financials[Amount]),
    Dim_Account[Account_Type] = "Revenue"
)
________________________________________
Total Expenses
Total Expenses =
CALCULATE(
    SUM(Fact_Financials[Amount]),
    Dim_Account[Account_Type] = "Expense"
)
________________________________________
Net Profit
Net Profit =
[Total Revenue] - [Total Expenses]
________________________________________
Profit Margin
Profit Margin =
DIVIDE([Net Profit], [Total Revenue]) * 100
________________________________________
